  "reference": "1 Weche Mag Ndalo 5",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Ochiw Thuolo Motingʼo Loko Manyien™ Weg Loko © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 otim gi Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open New Luo Translation™ Copyright © 1980, 2002, 2003, 2020 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" en sai mondik mongorore e piny Amerika kendo en kido moyie malongʼo e ofis Biblica, Inc. Itiyo kode gi thuolo moa kuom Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyikwa Reuben",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Reuben ne en wuod Israel makayo, to kane oterore gi chi wuon mare, to duongʼ mar ngʼat makayo nomi yawuot Josef ma wuod Israel, omiyo nyinge ne ok nyal wuok mokwongo ka indiko nying nyikwa Israel kaluwore gi chik mar kayo.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata obedo ni Juda ema ne tek moloyo owetene kendo ruoth nowuok kuome, to duongʼ mar kayo ne mar Josef.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawuot Reuben wuod Israel makayo ne gin:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 5:3"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hanok, Palu, Hezron kod Karmi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joka Joel ne gin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joel nonywolo Shemaya, Shemaya nonywolo Gog,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gog nonywolo Shimei,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimei nonywolo Mika,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mika nonywolo Reaya, Reaya nonywolo Baal,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baal nonywolo Beera mane Tiglath-Pilesa ruodh Asuria otero e twech. Beera ema ne jatend joka Reuben.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To owete kowuok e anywola, kaka ondikgi e chenro mar nywolgi ema:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeyel ne jatelo, Zekaria,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kod Bela wuod Azaz, ma wuod Shema, wuod Joel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b",
        "vid": "1CH 5:8"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1CH 5:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Negidak e gwengʼ kochakore Aroer nyaka Nebo kod Baal Meon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koa yo wuok chiengʼ, negidak e piny mokiewo gi thim kadhi nyaka Aora Yufrate nikech jambgi ne omedore e piny Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ndalo loch Saulo, negikedo gi jo-Hagri mane giloyo ma gikawo kuondegi mag dak duto e piny machiegni gi Gilead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyikwa Gad",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo-Gad nodak e bathgi e piny Bashan nyaka chop Saleka.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joel ne jatendgi ka iluwe gi Shafam, Janai kod Shafat, e piny Bashan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owetene abiriyo kaluwore gi anywolagi ne gin:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2",
        "vid": "1CH 5:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mikael, Meshulam, Sheba, Jorai, Jakan, Zia kod Eber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi ema ne yawuot Abihail wuod Huri, ma wuod Jaroa, wuod Gilead, wuod Mikael, wuod Jeshishai, wuod Jado, wuod Buz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "li2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahi wuod Abdiel, wuod Guni ne en jatend anywolagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joka Gad nodak Gilead, Bashan to gi mier mokiewo kode kod lek mar Sharon duto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi duto ne ondiki e nonro margi mar nywol e ndalo loch Jotham ruodh Juda kod Jeroboam ruodh Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joka Reuben, joka Gad kod nus mar dhood joka Manase ne gin ji alufu piero angʼwen gangʼwen mia abiriyo gi piero auchiel (44,760) mane oyikore ni lweny. Jolweny molony mane nyalo tiyo gi gige lweny machalo kuodi, ligangla kod atungʼ, nomi tiegruok ne lweny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negikedo gi jo-Hagri, jo-Jetur, jo-Nafish kod jo-Nodab.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne okonygi kuom kedo kendo Nyasaye nomiyogi e lwetgi jo-Hagri, to gi jogo duto mane oriwore kodgi nikech ne giywagorene e ndalo lweny. To ne odwoko lamogi nikech negiketo yie margi kuome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Negipeyo jamni mag jo-Hagri, ngamia alufu piero abich (50,000), rombe alufu mia ariyo gi piero abich (250,000), to gi punde alufu ariyo (2,000). To bende negimako ji alufu mia achiel (100,000) ma gitero e twech,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to mamoko mangʼeny to neginego, nikech lweny ne mar Nyasaye. Pinyni nobedo margi nyaka ne otergi e twech.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nus mar dhood jo-Manase",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nus mar dhood jo-Manase ne ngʼeny mokadho; negidak e piny jo-Bashan nyaka Baal Hermon, gi Senir ma en Got Hermon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magi ema ne jotelo mar anywolagi: Efer, Ishi, Eliel Azriel, Jeremia, Hodavia kod Jadiel. Ne gin jolweny mathuondi kendo marahuma kendo jotend anywolagi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To negiweyo Nyasach kweregi ma gindhogore kendgi gi nyiseche mag jopinyno mane Nyasaye owachonegi ni ginegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
